# Build artifacts
target/
pkg/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Cargo.lock

# Vendored dependency tree — reconstructible with `cargo vendor` (see README "Offline builds").
# Kept out of git to keep the repo lean; forks/ + [patch.crates-io] are committed.
vendor/
.cargo/config.toml

# Model-derived test fixtures (exported from ainekko/smolvla_base_onnx — not redistributed here).
# Regenerate with the projector export script; the small self-authored fixtures ARE committed.
crates/ferric-onnx/testdata/proj/

# ad-hoc headless test scripts (hardcoded local Chrome path)
crates/ferric-web/*_test.mjs
# ...except the wasm RUN gate. A build gate cannot replace it: `std::env::var` returns Err on wasm32
# and `Instant::now()` panics — both compile clean, both broke browser speech. This one takes Chrome
# from $CHROME rather than hardcoding it, so the reason for the blanket rule does not apply.
!crates/ferric-web/speech_test.mjs
crates/ferric-web/site/pkg/
.phase0/

# Transient audit probes written by analysis agents; promoted deliberately if they earn it.
crates/*/examples/_audit_*.rs
crates/*/examples/*_offset_probe.rs
